    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLAY NOW!</h1><p></p><br><h1>PLAY NOW!</h1><p></p><br><h1>WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the abandoned levels of Banban\u2019s Kindergarten. Survive the residents of the establishment that was left suspiciously empty. Uncover the truth behind the place, and find the whereabouts of your missing child\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/c348903c246862d9b3305041cb507e6d.poster.avif?t=1750914491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/c348903c246862d9b3305041cb507e6d.webm?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/c348903c246862d9b3305041cb507e6d.mp4?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the abandoned lower levels of Banban\u2019s Kindergarten:With no direction to go but down, you are forced to delve into even deeper levels of the mysterious establishment that is Banban\u2019s kindergarten. Little do you know, you are heading down to where no human has been for quite some time\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/e275ce2ec69f472b415cf4dcf2231266.poster.avif?t=1750914491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/e275ce2ec69f472b415cf4dcf2231266.webm?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/e275ce2ec69f472b415cf4dcf2231266.mp4?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/62d47c2f9cc662033e726c9dd8eaed3d.poster.avif?t=1750914491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/62d47c2f9cc662033e726c9dd8eaed3d.webm?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/62d47c2f9cc662033e726c9dd8eaed3d.mp4?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Even more friends to make!With an entire underworld for you to explore and survive, you will be having plenty of opportunities to finally make some friends. Despite the suspicious lack of humans in the entire establishment, you will never feel alone! In Banban\u2019s Kindergarten, there are friends to be made in every corner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/b409f92b367f80d1ea8aec6bb01cf017.poster.avif?t=1750914491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/b409f92b367f80d1ea8aec6bb01cf017.webm?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/b409f92b367f80d1ea8aec6bb01cf017.mp4?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/feadce633aa0e3a6bbcc0b2d13ea6afc.poster.avif?t=1750914491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/feadce633aa0e3a6bbcc0b2d13ea6afc.webm?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383120/extras/feadce633aa0e3a6bbcc0b2d13ea6afc.mp4?t=1750914491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
